Similarly, '/usr/sbin/farmd farmd -farm psefarm' yields:

9222:/usr/sbin/farmd: /sbin/loader: Error: unresolvable symbol in /usr/sbin/farmd: which_db_entry
9222:/usr/sbin/farmd: /sbin/loader: Error: unresolvable symbol in /usr/sbin/farmd: create_new_member
